{"1412400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zoxel", "steam_appid": 1412400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Voxel RPG in a Vast, Procedurally Generated Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, Traveler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You seem lost.<br>Perhaps you’re searching for adventure and riches?<br>No? Then maybe a quieter life—tending crops beneath alien skies, far from the endless noise of the City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But deep down, you know the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re searching for <strong>purpose</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly wandering these worlds, driven forward by something you can’t quite name…<br>A pull that never fades—no matter how far you travel, or how dangerous the path becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/7c43a748ed3f067d395b8702529ae6a2.poster.avif?t=1766077174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/7c43a748ed3f067d395b8702529ae6a2.webm?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/7c43a748ed3f067d395b8702529ae6a2.mp4?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a distant planet, in lands unknown. With nothing but your body and your will to survive, you take on quests from local villagers—hoping, at first, simply <strong>not to die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow stronger, you develop your attributes and skills, tackle greater challenges, and descend into dangerous dungeons in search of rare treasures. Along the way, fragments of your past begin to surface as you explore deeper into the ever-expanding multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world tells a story.<br>Every decision shapes who—or what—you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/b575c259234611421ca7a6701c11b3e2.poster.avif?t=1766077174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/b575c259234611421ca7a6701c11b3e2.webm?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/b575c259234611421ca7a6701c11b3e2.mp4?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully <strong>Generate and Customize Your Voxel Body</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve Attributes and Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Gear <i>or</i> Replace Body Parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Hunger and Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Classes: <strong>Warrior, Mage, or Rogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase Skills through Deep Skill Trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Jobs: <strong>Miner, Lumberjack, Herbalist</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a <strong>House, Shop, or Farm</strong> in Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise <strong>Penguin Farms</strong> to support your growing penguin family 🐧</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, Plunder, and Craft Unique Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with NPCs or Take on Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Unique Races and Their DNA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Darkest, Most Dangerous Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel Across a <strong>Procedurally Generated Universe of Voxel Planets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump Through Dimensional Portals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is Procedurally Generated</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zoxel is Open!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious to explore the universe for yourself?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>Check out the code on Codeberg</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>Play the demo on itch.io</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Voxel RPG in a Vast, Procedurally Generated Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome, Traveler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You seem lost.<br>Perhaps you’re searching for adventure and riches?<br>No? Then maybe a quieter life—tending crops beneath alien skies, far from the endless noise of the City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But deep down, you know the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re searching for <strong>purpose</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly wandering these worlds, driven forward by something you can’t quite name…<br>A pull that never fades—no matter how far you travel, or how dangerous the path becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/7c43a748ed3f067d395b8702529ae6a2.poster.avif?t=1766077174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/7c43a748ed3f067d395b8702529ae6a2.webm?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/7c43a748ed3f067d395b8702529ae6a2.mp4?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Journey Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a distant planet, in lands unknown. With nothing but your body and your will to survive, you take on quests from local villagers—hoping, at first, simply <strong>not to die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow stronger, you develop your attributes and skills, tackle greater challenges, and descend into dangerous dungeons in search of rare treasures. Along the way, fragments of your past begin to surface as you explore deeper into the ever-expanding multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world tells a story.<br>Every decision shapes who—or what—you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/b575c259234611421ca7a6701c11b3e2.poster.avif?t=1766077174\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/b575c259234611421ca7a6701c11b3e2.webm?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/extras/b575c259234611421ca7a6701c11b3e2.mp4?t=1766077174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully <strong>Generate and Customize Your Voxel Body</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve Attributes and Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Gear <i>or</i> Replace Body Parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Hunger and Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Classes: <strong>Warrior, Mage, or Rogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase Skills through Deep Skill Trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Jobs: <strong>Miner, Lumberjack, Herbalist</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy a <strong>House, Shop, or Farm</strong> in Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise <strong>Penguin Farms</strong> to support your growing penguin family 🐧</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, Plunder, and Craft Unique Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with NPCs or Take on Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Unique Races and Their DNA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Darkest, Most Dangerous Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel Across a <strong>Procedurally Generated Universe of Voxel Planets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump Through Dimensional Portals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is Procedurally Generated</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zoxel is Open!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious to explore the universe for yourself?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>Check out the code on Codeberg</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>Play the demo on itch.io</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Journey through vast, procedurally generated worlds and dungeons filled with monsters and danger. The farther you venture, the greater the challenge. Grow your strength, refine your skills, and rise from a fragile traveler to a powerful god.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The landscapes are really trippy, felt like minecraft on acid, i like it.”<br>Acid – No_Blood_5393<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/header.jpg?t=1766077174", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1412400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766077174", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.ak